---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "September 6, 2026";
---

<Layout
    title="Terms & Conditions — MemeMaker"
    description="Terms of service and fair use guidelines for creating and downloading memes on MemeMaker."
>
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left">
            <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Legal Terms</p>
            <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-[#8f8f97]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#c4c4cc]">
            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16161a] p-6 sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    By accessing and using <strong>MemeMaker</strong> (<a href="https://realmememaker.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">realmememaker.com</a>), you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions of use. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you should immediately cease use of the service.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16161a] p-6 sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">2. License &amp; Permitted Use</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    MemeMaker grants you a personal, worldwide, royalty-free, non-assignable, and non-exclusive license to use the web application for personal, editorial, parody, satirical, and non-commercial or commercial commentary purposes.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    Downloaded memes are provided to you free of charge without any added proprietary watermarks.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16161a] p-6 sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">3. User-Generated Content &amp; Prohibited Conduct</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    You are solely responsible for all images, captions, graphics, and text that you upload or produce using MemeMaker. You agree not to use the service to create, store, or distribute:
                </p>
                <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-[#a8a8b2]">
                    <li>Content that promotes hate speech, discrimination, harassment, or violence.</li>
                    <li>Defamatory, illegal, pornographic, or non-consensual imagery.</li>
                    <li>Malicious code, automated scrapers, or excessive traffic intended to disrupt site infrastructure.</li>
                    <li>Content that infringes upon third-party trademarks, copyrights, or privacy rights.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16161a] p-6 sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">4. Intellectual Property &amp; Fair Use</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    MemeMaker does not claim ownership of user-uploaded images or user-created meme captions. Classic meme templates featured on the platform originate from internet cultural discourse and are used in good faith under fair use doctrines for commentary, education, parody, and satire.
                </p>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    If you are a copyright holder and believe any template infringes upon your copyright, please contact us immediately for prompt review and takedown under the DMCA.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16161a] p-6 sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    MemeMaker is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. We do not warrant that the service will be error-free, uninterrupted, or completely free of harmful components.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16161a] p-6 sm:p-8">
                <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink">6. Modifications &amp; Governing Law</h2>
                <p class="mt-3">
                    We reserve the right to revise these Terms &amp; Conditions at any time. Your continued use of the site constitutes your acceptance of the updated terms.
                </p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>
